---
pagination:
  data: regions
  size: 1
  alias: region
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "/{{ region.slug }}/"
modified: "2026-10-08"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Elderly Removals in {{ region.short }} | Chayce"
  description: "Elderly removals, downsizing help and later-life moving in {{ region.short }}, arranged from Northampton with one coordinator. Packages from £995."
---
<div class="pg-hero" style="background-image:url({% imageUrl region.img %});{% imageSet region.img %}">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/areas-we-cover/">Areas We Cover</a> / <em>{{ region.short }}</em></p>
    <h1>Elderly Removals &amp; Downsizing Help in <em>{{ region.name }}</em></h1>
    <p class="lead">Later-life moving support from our Northampton base, with one coordinator from first call to settling in</p>
    <div class="pg-chips">
      <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11a7 7 0 0114 0c0 4.8-7 11-7 11z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5"/></svg>Northampton base</span>
      <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 8-7 10-4-2-7-5.5-7-10V6l7-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>DBS-checked staff</span>
      <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8l9-5 9 5v8l-9 5-9-5V8z"/><path d="M3 8l9 5 9-5M12 13v8"/></svg>Fully insured removals</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="sa-block" style="padding:48px 0 12px;background:#fff">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stage-practice" style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto"><p><strong>Short answer</strong>Chayce Properties arranges elderly removals, downsizing help, careful packing and settling-in support in {{ region.name | replace('The ', 'the ') }}, with one dedicated coordinator and DBS-checked staff. We are based in Northampton, and packages start from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }}.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gd-sec">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="rx-lead">
      <div class="rx-photo">{% image region.img, "A home in " + region.name + " ready for a later-life move" %}<div class="rx-tag">based in<strong>Northampton</strong>working UK-wide</div></div>
      <div class="rx-copy">
        <span class="gd-eyebrow" style="text-align:left">{{ region.short }}</span>
        <h2>{{ region.h2 | safe }}</h2>
        <p class="rx-sub">{{ region.intro }}</p>
        <ul class="rx-points">
          {% for c in region.cards %}<li><i class="fas {{ c.icon }}" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>{{ c.title }}</h3><p>{{ c.text }}</p></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="rx-band" style="background-image:url({% imageUrl region.img %});{% imageSet region.img %}">
  <div class="container"><span class="gd-eyebrow">Getting there from Northampton</span><h2>Planned around <em style="font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-light)">realistic travel times</em></h2><p style="margin-bottom:18px">{{ region.note }}</p><p class="rx-bandlinks">Start with a <a href="/discovery/">Discovery Consultation (&pound;150)</a>, or see <a href="/packages/">packages and prices</a>, <a href="/downsizing-help-for-elderly/">downsizing help</a> and <a href="/areas-we-cover/">all the areas we cover</a>.</p></div>
</section>

<section class="pkg-faq-band">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>{{ region.short }}: your questions answered</h2>
    <div class="pkg-faq">
      {% for f in region.faqs %}<details><summary>{{ f.q }}</summary><p>{{ f.a }}</p></details>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ac-intro" style="background:var(--bg-warm)">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="ac-intro-copy" style="margin-bottom:32px"><span class="ac-eyebrow">Other regions</span><h2>Moving somewhere <em>else?</em></h2></div>
    <div class="ac-tiles">
      {% for r in regions %}{% if r.slug != region.slug %}<a href="/{{ r.slug }}/" class="ac-tile" style="background-image:url({% imageUrl r.img %})"><span class="ac-tile-n">{{ r.n }}</span><span class="ac-tile-t">{{ r.short }}</span></a>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}<a href="/elderly-removals-northampton/" class="ac-tile" style="background-image:url({% imageUrl "chayce-uk-northampton.jpg" %})"><span class="ac-tile-n">HQ</span><span class="ac-tile-t">Northampton</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pkg-close-cta">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Planning a move in {{ region.short }}?</h2>
    <p>Tell us a little about your situation and we&rsquo;ll help you find the right next step.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a href="/discovery/" class="primary">Book a Discovery Consultation</a>
      <a href="/contact/" class="ghost">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"{{ site.url }}/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Areas We Cover","item":"{{ site.url }}/areas-we-cover/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"{{ region.short }}","item":"{{ site.url }}/{{ region.slug }}/"}]}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{% for f in region.faqs %}{"@type":"Question","name":{{ f.q | dump | safe }},"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":{{ f.a | dump | safe }}}}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}]}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","url":"{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}","inLanguage":"en-GB","speakable":{"@type":"SpeakableSpecification","cssSelector":["h1",".sa-block p"]}}</script>
